  Headline: Newspaper!
  Text: 'The News! A steady source of information to talk about in your Podcasts.
    Be warned though, as not all News Agencies are trustworthy or even relevant!
    They will tell you what topics are currently hot in demand and thus useful for
    your Podcast! There is also some News that is connected! However some story lines
    will take time to unfold!

'
